Source provenance

This repository starts from the v2.1.2 source snapshot of the project maintained
by kxn at https://github.com/kxn/codex-remote-feishu, revision ab73118.

The imported implementation, documentation, tests, and release notes retain
their upstream authorship. This repository adds local desktop-sharing support,
Feishu integration changes, and publication configuration for
https://github.com/YChange01/codex-feishu-link.

The executable name remains codex-feishu-relay for compatibility with its
configuration, service, and packaging interfaces.
